--- edor-1.orig/readme.md
+++ edor-1/readme.md
@@ -18,7 +18,7 @@ yay -Sy edor
 Or <i>.zst</i>(x86_64) or <i>.xz</i>(aarch64) file from [releases](https://github.com/colin-i/edor/releases).
 \
 \
-On Fedora 43/44(x86_64 aarch64):
+On Fedora 43/44/45(x86_64 aarch64):
 ```sh
 sudo dnf copr enable colin/project
 sudo dnf install edor
@@ -31,9 +31,9 @@ zypper addrepo https://download.opensuse
 ```
 For openSUSE Leap:
 ```sh
-zypper addrepo https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/home:costin/openSUSE_Leap_16.0/home:costin.repo
+zypper addrepo https://download.opensuse.org/repositories/home:costin/openSUSE_Leap_16.1/home:costin.repo
 ```
-Replace *16.0*(x86_64 aarch64) with *15.6*(x86_64/i586 aarch64) if needed.\
+Replace *16.1*(x86_64 aarch64) with *16.0*(x86_64 aarch64) or *15.6*(x86_64/i586 aarch64) if needed.\
 And:
 ```sh
 zypper refresh
